WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.716 --> 00:00:09.865
Resilience is not a solo trait. This page maps the resources around you, which is the course's social ecology argument made personal.

2
00:00:09.865 --> 00:00:18.269
Work outward from yourself. Name what you control, then the people, services, and structures around you that hold you up.

3
00:00:18.269 --> 00:00:25.868
Be concrete. A named person beats a category. Write the actual tutor, the actual friend, the actual service.

4
00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:36.875
Notice the gaps without judging them. A thin ring is information about your environment, not a verdict on you. Navigating toward resources is the skill the course teaches.

5
00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:41.195
This is private reflection. It is never seen or scored.

6
00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:46.568
Where next: Bring one insight from your map into this week's reflection.
